    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abramu ghaweat Lutu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damanda Amrafeli was sugoocheanda Shinari, ea Ariyoki was sugoocheanda Elasa, ea Gedorlaomeri was sugoocheanda Elamu, ea Didali was sugoocheanda Goimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iimuchu gang'uchi sugoodisu sea sugoocheanda Sodoma siguura Bera, nea sugoocheanda siguura Birsha bea ng'eanyiida Gomora, ea Shinabi bea ng'eanyiida Adma, ea Shemeba bea ng'eanyiida Seboimu, ea sugoocheanda Bela (was Seari). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean googuuyi sugoodisu shirikareeda nyaawa aba moangoachiyda Sidimu (nea, balang'da). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goobiida jeeda gheambalmeeda Gedorlaoma gweanyeew damaniyeenya, hita gweaydeaba damasamwagu geaheawa eesisa mureeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hita gweaydeaba damanang'wan ghwahidu Gedorlaoma sea maseawdaanyi ea lugweega nyaawa ak ghwajoar fuga Refayimu aba Ashterot-garnaimu, ea fuga Susi aba Hamu, ea fuga Emi aba Shawe-giryataimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea fuga Hori aba giijeega Seiri ea ghwahita El-parani mida ghuuta dareapcheeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu gwayamu geat ea ghwahidu Enmishpati (nea Gadeshi), ak ghwajoar darooraka sean bea Maleki, ak eara fuga Amori abiita Hasason-tamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanda shirikareanyaawa sugoodiga Sodoma, ea dea Gomora, ea sugoocheanda Adma, ea sugoocheanda Seboimu, ea sugoocheanda Bela (nea Seari), hean gaweay eara saawa ng'ucheeda aba moangoachiyda Sidimu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Gedorlaoma gil was sugoocheanda Elamu, Didali was sugoocheanda Goimu, Amrafeli Elasa, sugoodi ang'wan ng'uchi muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda moangoachiyda Sidimu ghwanyiit shoomeanga hideeda; iimuchu nea nimng'aw sugoodiga Sodoma ea Gomora, gang'adeesa mwaatkwa shoomeanga, nea gamng'awsa suurja uhuuda giijeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu lugooda ak gageanda haleanjeeda sean bea Sodoma ea Gomora, ea hamichoojiga nyaawa sean, ak gaweay heechea gaweay; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu ghwaat eara Lutu was orjeeda geenyea Abramu, abiita ng'eanyiida Sodoma ea haleanjeadaanyi ak gawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu siyagi heeta mang'aw, ak gwayeesha Abramu was siida Ebraniya, abiita murdeeda sabiida Mamre was siida Amori, was orjeeda geenyea Eshkoli ea dea Ana; fiisu suh bareanda Abramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwayiiy Abramu gideaba siing'waay buweacheandaanyi, hean goosheedeawa fugaaschi siikearniit muuchi, was fuga sijiilsa gheanyi, fih bughalaji samwagu ea sis, ak gaweay ghwaat geeshta ea ghwahita Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwaashaada geenga eawa ak ghwanung' gaweay gang'uchi nea goodeayi niny sea soomjoagaaschi, ak ghwajoar ak gamaseaw ea ghwahita Hoba, mida gayeewda Dameski. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hit ghoaghuumu haleanjeeda sean, ak goodeelu eara buweacheandaanyi was Lutu ea haleanjeadaanyi, ea gadeemga ea fuga siing'waay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Melkisedeki ghoadaw Abramu ghawooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gabiikna joorda Gedorlaoma sea sugoodiga mideawa, gawa sugoocheanda Sodoma roonyeeda aba mooheeda Shawe (nea, Mooheeda sugoocheanda). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweadu Melkisedeki was sugoocheanda Salemu mukaate ea difaayi; abeeda niny ashoohoocheanda ASEETA Hawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw ghawooda nea gwayeesha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
